{% set v = e.version %}
- Describes: the {{ v.describes }} version{% if v.doi %} (DOI {{ v.doi }}){% endif %}{% if v.printed_pages %}, printed pages {{ v.printed_pages }}{% endif %}.
- Spans taken from: {{ v.form }}{% if v.exact_form %}; exact form: {{ v.exact_form }}{% endif %}.
{% if v.arxiv %}
- arXiv: {{ v.arxiv }}
{% endif %}
{% if v.pmcid %}
- PMC: {{ v.pmcid }}
{% endif %}
{% if v.pdf_sha256 %}
- PDF SHA-256: `{{ v.pdf_sha256 }}`
{% endif %}
{% if v.page_range %}
- Pages processed: {{ v.page_range }}
{% endif %}
{% if v.parent_bibkey %}
- Part of: [{{ v.parent_bibkey }}]({{ v.parent_bibkey }}.md)
{% endif %}
{% if v.based_on %}
- **Substitute** for {{ v.based_on }}{{ " (original unavailable)" if v.original_unavailable else "" }}.
{% endif %}
{% for u in v.updates | default([]) %}
- **{{ u.label or u.type }}**: {{ u.doi }}{{ " (" ~ u.date ~ ")" if u.date else "" }}
{% endfor %}
{% if e.licence is defined %}
- Licence: {{ e.licence.value }} ({{ e.licence.provenance.source }})
{% endif %}
